> **Note:** Some names and codes in this guide are published in a different spelling from the one
> the DHIS2 instance it was built from holds. That instance holds names and codes the IG publisher
> cannot write into a page, such as a `<` in an age band, and this build rewrote them
> (`hostile_names = "substitute"`): `<` reads "under", `>` reads "over", and a space in a code
> becomes a hyphen. Every rewritten concept states the instance's own spelling as its `dhis2-name`
> or `dhis2-code` property. Once the names and codes are changed in DHIS2, the next build publishes
> them as the instance holds them.
